{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2023-01-05 19:02:00', 'title': 'PG&E CREWS OUT IN FULL FORCE RESTORING POWER AMID HISTORIC STORM CONDITIONS ACROSS NORTHERN AND CENTRAL CALIFORNIA', 'text': 'OAKLAND, CALIF. , JAN. 5, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WITH A HISTORIC SERIES OF WINTER STORMS DAMAGING ELECTRIC EQUIPMENT AND CAUSING POWER OUTAGES, PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) CREWS ARE MOBILIZED THROUGHOUT NORTHERN AND CENTRAL CALIFORNIA ASSESSING THE DAMAGE AND MAKING REPAIRS TO RESTORE POWER.'}